@JIITPlacement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104
@admin_token = paste_token_from_login_response_here

### Public job APIs (consumed by the frontend)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Accept: application/json

### Admin login
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@jiit",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### Job count (authenticated)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/count
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Start sync (authenticated; 409 when a sync is already running)
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sync status / final result (authenticated)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/sync/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout — invalidates the token immediately (authenticated)
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Unauthorized check — must return {"success":false,"message":"Unauthorized"}
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/count
Accept: application/json

###
